PetalburgCity_House1_Text_TravelingIsWonderful:
	.string "Traveling is wonderful!\p"
	.string "When I was young, I roamed seas and\n"
	.string "mountains!\p"
	.string "Now I roam the couch. Also wonderful.$"

PetalburgCity_House1_Text_GoOnAdventure:
	.string "Sigh…\p"
	.string "I wish I could go on an adventure with\n"
	.string "POKéMON…\p"
	.string "Damp grass… Rocky mountains… Dark\n"
	.string "caves…\p"
	.string "…Mosquitoes… No toilets… Getting lost…\p"
	.string "Actually, I'm good here.$"

